trand 2), and Raul (Strand 3) are active simultaneously as concurrent map pins. Furthermore, the Sinfrontera Bank Heist features 3 concurrent preparation tracks (Safecracker, Explosives, Codes & Van) that can be tackled in any order.\n395: \n396: ### 4. Any% Speedrun Optimization Summary\n397: - **Chapter 1 Downtime Optimization**: Run Branch 1 (*Unwanted Attention* $\\rightarrow$ *Pipework*) while *Feng Shui*'s 24-hour waiting window elapses.\n398: - **Skip All Social / Hot Meter Activities**: Ignore *Get Haircut*, *Buy Necklace*, *Buy Flowers*, *Buy Groceries*, and *Lucia's Clothes*.\n399: - **Save $75,000 Cash**: Keep at least $75,000 from the Sinfrontera Bank Heist ($10.5M take) to instantly bypass Abe Gonzalez's wire transfer gate in Chapter 4 (*Party Hard*).\n400: - **Select Ending B (*The Deal*)**: Accepting Mendez's immunity plea skips the multi-stage offshore Coast Guard gunboat battle, saving **8 to 12 minutes of real-world time** in Any% speedruns.\n401: \nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
