{"step_index":1038,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T03:11:46Z","content":"The mission flowcharts, campaign routing guide, and machine-readable dependency files have been updated to reflect the ground truth for **Build 1.0.2.1**.\n\n---\n\n### Key Ground-Truth Findings & Updates\n\n1. **Title Fix: `17. Don Gone` (`COM_KBOS_CLEAN`)**\n   - Verified against English `0DRP` localization tables (`data.rpf @ 0x19be000`, `table_0019be000.json` key hash `0x10BE4C94`). The in-game title is **`Don Gone`** (cleaning Donnie's trailer after his death in *Swamped*), resolving the community misspelling (`Doin' Gone`).\n\n2. **The Chapter 1 Climax Gauntlet (Missions 16–21)**\n   - Early community diagrams (e.g. `image_1188e9.jpg`) prematurely cut off after Donnie's trailer cleanup. Build 1.0.2.1 game data (`CMissions` table, `uiProgressDataset`, and `story000.rpf` mission list) confirms Chapter 1 spans **21 operations**:\n     - **16. Swamped (`INT_AIR`)**: Kingfishers ambush at Grassrivers; Donnie is killed, Lori is rescued, and Brian retires.\n     - **Side Branch off Donnie's Death** *(Any% Skippable)*:\n       - **17. Don Gone (`COM_KBOS_CLEAN`)**: Brian asks Jason to clean out Donnie's trailer evidence.\n       - **18. Recalibration (`HO_PAR_KEYCO`)**: Jason and Lucia take a grieving Cal fishing.\n     - **Mandatory Finale Gauntlet**:\n       - **19. Tourist Trap (`BIL_PICK`)**: Disguised bag pickup at Grassrivers Visitor Center locker (`10:00–17:00` vs. `17:00–10:00` trigger window). Dirty cops ambush the scene and Jason is critically shot; Cal rushes him to Vice City Hospital.\n       - **20. Home Sweet Home (`BIL_HOUSE`)**: Lucia solo mission retrieving Jason's stash in Hamlet while cartel hitmen torch their house.\n       - **21. Discharge Time (`BIL_WHEEL`)**: **★ TRUE CHAPTER 1 CLIMAX ★**. Lucia infiltrates Vice City Hospital to save Jason; they fight through dirty cops and cartel gunmen, hijack an ambulance, and escape west into Kelly County / Port Gellhorn.\n     - **Transition to Chapter 2 (`MTL_WAKE`)**: Hard cut to Starlet Motel in Port Gellhorn.\n\n3. **All 7 Verified Any% Auto-Flag Skips (`func_\n<truncated 241 bytes>\n (`COM_KBOS_SHOP`, Hash `0x2D7D2164`)\n     2. **`Unwanted Attention`** (`COM_KBOS_COLAT`, Hash `0x5AE70594`)\n     3. **`Pipework`** (`COM_KBOS_NEIGHB`, Hash `0xC8513199`)\n     4. **`Hey Arnold!`** (`COM_KBOS_RADR`, Hash `0x21D03E4F`)\n     5. **`Don Gone`** (`COM_KBOS_CLEAN`, Hash `0x10BE4C94`)\n     6. **`Recalibration`** (`HO_PAR_KEYCO`, Hash `0x420623AF`)\n     7. **`Island Dreams`** (`CSC_TRH_CHART`, Hash `0x617A1865`)\n\n4. **Exact Trigger Windows & Protagonists Included**:\n   - `Clear Skies` (`INT_PLNSH`): `07:00–23:00` window (Jason)\n   - `Day Release` (`BIL_FUN`): `07:00–17:00` window (Jason & Lucia)\n   - `Tourist Trap` (`BIL_PICK`): `BIL_PICK_DAY_TIME_START` (`10:00–17:00`) vs. `BIL_PICK_NIGHT_TIME_START` (`17:00–10:00`)\n   - `Hey Arnold!` (`COM_KBOS_RADR`): `08:00–16:00` window (Jason)\n\n---\n\n### Updated Artifacts & Deliverables\n\n- **Chapter 1 High-Resolution Diagram**:\n  - [flowchart_chapter_1.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/flowchart_chapter_1.png)\n  - [GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/GTAVI_SPEEDRUN_CHAPTER1_COMPLETE.png)\n- **Combined 5-Chapter Master Routing Map**:\n  - [flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/flowchart_all_chapters_combined.png)\n- **Comprehensive Markdown Campaign Guide**:\n  - [gta6_mission_flow_chart.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/gta%206%20mission%20workflow%20charts/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md)\n- **Mission Order & Speedrun Route Notes**:\n  - [mission_order.json](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/mission_order.json)\n  - [SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/SPEEDRUN_ROUTING_NOTES.md)\n  - [mission_flow.mmd](file:///C:/Users/<user>/Downloads/antigravity_version/mission_flow.mmd)\n\n*All files have been generated, validated, and synchronized across `gta 6 mission workflow charts/`, `antigravity_version/`, and the primary workspace.*","truncated_fields":["content"]}
